WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.171
Unit seven. Understanding URLs!

2
00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:10.088
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.138 --> 00:00:13.394
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:17.643
Today we learn about Understanding URLs. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:23.892
URL. Say it with me. URL!

6
00:00:27.391 --> 00:00:32.225
Website address. Say it with me. Website address!

7
00:00:35.697 --> 00:00:39.481
Domain. Say it with me. Domain!

8
00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:47.022
Https. Say it with me. Https!

9
00:00:50.531 --> 00:00:54.064
Link. Say it with me. Link!

10
00:00:57.566 --> 00:01:01.315
Browser. Say it with me. Browser!

11
00:01:04.811 --> 00:01:08.932
Navigate. Say it with me. Navigate!

12
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:16.990
Web address. Say it with me. Web address!

13
00:01:20.457 --> 00:01:29.245
A URL is a website address I type into a browser to navigate to a page. It often starts with https and includes a domain.

14
00:01:29.294 --> 00:01:33.461
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.276 --> 00:01:40.743
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.793 --> 00:01:41.943
Domain!

17
00:01:42.865 --> 00:01:48.412
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.462 --> 00:01:49.648
Navigate!

19
00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:59.437
Did you know? The 's' in 'https' stands for 'secure', meaning the connection to that website is encrypted!

20
00:01:59.487 --> 00:02:02.160
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.912 --> 00:02:12.032
Think and answer. What is the URL of a website you visit often?

22
00:02:12.082 --> 00:02:13.318
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:19.702
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.752 --> 00:02:22.961
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

